{"id":"ef8a67cd2bf5faf4","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-regular-ultrafilter-existence.md","title":"Existence of a Regular Ultrafilter","display":"thm-regular-ultrafilter-existence — Existence of a Regular Ultrafilter","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-regular-ultrafilter-existence","aliases":["17-thm-regular-ultrafilter-existence"],"display":"thm-regular-ultrafilter-existence — Existence of a Regular Ultrafilter","depends_on":["[[17-df-regular-ultrafilter]]","[[17-ax-zfc]]","[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed","legacy_label":"17-thm-4.5.2","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-regular-ultrafilter-existence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-regular-ultrafilter-existence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-regular-ultrafilter-existence — Existence of a Regular Ultrafilter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6d889fd6c75f33af\" href=\"?note=6d889fd6c75f33af\" title=\"17-df-regular-ultrafilter\">17-df-regular-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"abe3ba268ec527f0\" href=\"?note=abe3ba268ec527f0\" title=\"17-ax-zfc\">17-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-4.5.2"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"abe3ba268ec527f0\" href=\"?note=abe3ba268ec527f0\" title=\"17-ax-zfc\">17-ax-zfc</a> 的 ZFC 元理论中工作；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 为候选集合。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Regular}_\\kappa\">\\(\\operatorname{Regular}_\\kappa\\)</span> (regular-ultrafilter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6d889fd6c75f33af\" href=\"?note=6d889fd6c75f33af\" title=\"17-df-regular-ultrafilter\">17-df-regular-ultrafilter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span> (least infinite cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li>选择公理使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"abe3ba268ec527f0\" href=\"?note=abe3ba268ec527f0\" title=\"17-ax-zfc\">17-ax-zfc</a> 中的显式选择函数公理，不调用不存在的外部公理标签。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists U\\;\n\\operatorname{Regular}_\\kappa(U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists U\\;\n\\operatorname{Regular}_\\kappa(U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The regularizing family is part of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Regular}_\\kappa(U)\">\\(\\operatorname{Regular}_\\kappa(U)\\)</span> by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6d889fd6c75f33af\" href=\"?note=6d889fd6c75f33af\" title=\"17-df-regular-ultrafilter\">17-df-regular-ultrafilter</a> and need not be repeated in the theorem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-regular-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"6d889fd6c75f33af","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-regular-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"abe3ba268ec527f0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"abe3ba268ec527f0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在 [[17-ax-zfc]] 的 ZFC 元理论中工作；$\\kappa$ 为候选集合。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-regular-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"6d889fd6c75f33af","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Regular}_\\kappa$ (regular-ultrafilter predicate, see [[17-df-regular-ultrafilter]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anch